# Computah's pre-fight lines, and they are Greyson's joke rather than his: Computah is sitting in the
# ring with a flat battery and says nothing at all. Greyson is not in the arena - he is a
# dialogue-only character now - so these are shouted down from the stands.
# The "do" lines play the entrance's beats (in ComputahIntro.gd) and the dialogue waits for each one
# to finish before the next line. THE DEAD AIR IS THE PUNCHLINE: "go get him buddy" is not the
# robot's command syntax, so nothing_happens() holds an empty ring for three seconds before Greyson
# works out why, and the command that IS his syntax is what charges him.
~ start
Greyson: go get him buddy
do nothing_happens()
Greyson: oh right my bad
Greyson: computah, kill this gay freaking bald idiot
do battery_charges_up()
=> END
